        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n_gram" value="&lt;b&gt;Code grammar&lt;/b&gt;  (PERMISSION_CODE_RE in nx_lib/security.py)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;lt;area&amp;gt;[.&amp;lt;object&amp;gt;[.&amp;lt;sub&amp;gt;]].&amp;lt;action&amp;gt;[.&amp;lt;scope&amp;gt;]&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;areas: admin workitems dashboard reporting process tenant api jd&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;(tenant.&amp;lt;code&amp;gt; and process.&amp;lt;client&amp;gt; are two-segment areas)&lt;br&gt;actions: view add edit delete use run export schedule manage bypass import restart&lt;br&gt;scopes: org · all · pastdeadline  — no scope means own records&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;lt;area&amp;gt;.view is the landing page and gates everything beneath it in the&lt;br&gt;admin grid — a &lt;i&gt;UI convention only&lt;/i&gt;; the server checks each code alone.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Renamed by #238, applied by migration 0088. Detail: docs/design/permissions.md" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1">
