        <mxCell id="n_pref" value="&lt;b&gt;UI preferences&lt;/b&gt; are allowlisted JSON in dbo.Users.ui_prefs&lt;br&gt;(nx_lib/ui_prefs.py), applied pre-paint in templates/_header.html,&lt;br&gt;edited on /appearance. &lt;b&gt;Never cache them in the session&lt;/b&gt; (#155)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1">
